# Generated minimum-word orbit supports

This file is generated by `generate_minimum_word_orbits.py`.  Each list holds the 91
supports of one orbit of the symmetric-square action of `PGL(2,13)` on the displayed
weight-twelve representative, in the order in which the normalized projective matrices
first produce them.  A support is the 78-bit natural number whose set bits are the
positions of its points in the normalized internal-point order.  The last list is the
union of the four orbits without repetition.  Lean checks every list against the
projective action itself; the lists carry no trust of their own.
-/

